@startuml RF45_MaquinaDeEstados_Pedido
!pragma layout smetana
title RF45 — CaptureRequest: pedido de foto complementar (vista + propósito)
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #F8F4FF
  BorderColor #B695F5
  FontColor #2D2438
  ArrowColor #52606D
}
state "PENDING" as Pendente
state "FULFILLED" as Atendido
state "SKIPPED" as Pulado
state "SUPERSEDED" as Substituido

[*] --> Pendente : AdaptiveCaptureEngine.decide\n(view, purpose, need, expectedGain, confidenceBefore)
Pendente --> Atendido : POST /api/capture/sessions/{id}/images <<planejado>>\n(fulfilledImageId, confidenceAfter)
Pendente --> Pulado : POST .../requests/{requestId}/skip <<planejado>>
Pendente --> Substituido : nova decisão torna o pedido inútil\n(ex.: marca chegou a >= 0,90)
Atendido --> [*]
Pulado --> [*]
Substituido --> [*]
note right of Pendente : CaptureNeed STRONGLY_RECOMMENDED | RECOMMENDED | OPTIONAL\nnenhum bloqueia o cadastro (RN45.03)
note right of Atendido : ganho realizado = confidenceAfter − confidenceBefore\nrecalibra os pesos informs(v, sinal)
@enduml
